https://mizjeannie.com/spells-workings/charm-bag-spell-for-listening-without-losing-your-position&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait reference card with readable black text, muted-pink borders and crescent ornaments on a cream background. A rustic photograph shows rosemary, cotton fabric, thread, and a metal charm, with a finished charm bag on a shelf. All approved instructions, quantities, spoken words, and cautions are present. The gold botanical mountain-and-river watermark at bottom right matches the second reference image." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ae556719162b.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:46:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>谁人乐队1970年的现场演出。永远是我最喜欢的一张他们的照片，即使看不到约翰。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae552388fd6f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;谁人乐队1970年的现场演出。永远是我最喜欢的一张他们的照片，即使看不到约翰。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the picture is from behind keith moon (drummer). pete townshend is mid-jump and you can see a large crowd. it's an outdoor fest at night" height="911" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/len/6ae552388fd6f.jpg" width="911"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://len.some.pics"&gt;@len&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:28:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae54c084eafb</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Thick white and gray clouds filling a blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ae54c084eafb.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:01:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>五点起床去沙发补觉</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae54b98e4e40</link><description>&lt;p&gt;早上5点醒来，就为了在沙发上再多睡一个小时 ;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Me, laying in the couch, with my cat chilling on my arm. " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/axel/6ae54b98e4e40.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://axel.some.pics"&gt;@axel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:59:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>酒店窗外波士顿</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae531e27827a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;从酒店窗户眺望波士顿和查尔斯河的景色。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A view of Boston and the Charles River from a hotel window. " height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6ae531e27827a.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:10:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巫术也能庆祝美好</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae52c468d5e3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术也可以用来庆祝美好的事物。你可以系上一枚护身符，纪念完成一个项目，或为一件喜事点上一支蜡烛。你的修行不必只关注那些需要修补的事情。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy scene of a smiling, silver-haired witch tying a rose-pink ribbon charm to a garden tapestry on a charcoal-stone terrace overlooking floating palace staircases. Warm ivory lettering spans the upper arch, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft can celebrate good things, too. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ae52c468d5e3.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:46:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Massaroca</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae51e7d7560c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;马萨罗卡&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Nena dog" height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6ae51e7d7560c.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:47:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>还在想着Tudor's Biscuit World。:')</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae50064073bc</link><description>&lt;p&gt;还在想着Tudor's Biscuit World。:')&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A sausage, egg, cheese, and hash brown on a biscuit." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/azaleah/6ae50064073bc.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://azaleah.some.pics"&gt;@azaleah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:39:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>飞机上的景色令人惊叹！

写于我们在都柏林的公寓里 😊 我好累，但能来到这里真是太开心了。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae4fa7ec8e84</link><description>&lt;p&gt;飞机上的景色令人惊叹！

写于我们在都柏林的公寓里 😊 我好累，但能来到这里真是太开心了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="First view of Ireland from the plane. We’ve flown with the sunset colouring the sky red over the clouds. Astonishing!" height="2455" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6ae4fa7ec8e84.jpg" width="2019"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:13:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>飞机到达登机口</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae4bcae03983</link><description>&lt;p&gt;飞机抵达登机口 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Aer Lingus airplane arrives at the gate " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6ae4bcae03983.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:50:09 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>